01:00:18.340 --> 01:00:31.990
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he tried to give me his recipe for turducken. I don't know. I just don't think he got it right.
