01:00:31.990 --> 01:00:38.890
<v Max>It's pretty much just a little chicken, a little duck, and they were literally friends.
<v Max>基本就是讲一只小鸡、一只小鸭，它们真的是朋友。

01:00:38.890 --> 01:00:43.210
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回《美国生活》的更多故事。

01:00:43.210 --> 01:00:48.210
